      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "notices": [],
      "changes": [
        "Independently construct the one-copy Bell vector from the actual spectral embedding and the transported uniform pair; prove its normalization and orthogonal projection, and the exact coefficient sqrt(z)/|E| using the actual compressed typical vector. The sole mathematical premise is positive selected mass; the original vector need not be normalized. Tensor powers and complementary label projections are subsequent results."
      ],
